{"_note":"单条评论详情:全文 + 开发者回复 + 「去 ASC 回复」外链。路由 ?id=&app=。\n⚠️ 回复是写操作,本包密钥只读、凭证红线也不为一条回复升权 —— 外链出去。","type":"page","id":"asc-review","root":{"type":"container","id":"root","layout":"list","direction":"vertical","gap":"10pt","padding":"14pt","paddingTop":"${@contentInset.top}pt","paddingBottom":"24pt","depends":[{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/m-review.df]","params":{"id":"${id}"},"_note":"单条便宜且回复态要新鲜,刻意不包 G23 缓存。"}],"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"full","h":"252pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-rvfull.rcn]"}},{"type":"Canvas","id":"secRp","h":"26pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-sec-rp.rcn]"}},{"type":"Canvas","id":"rp","h":"92pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-replybox.rcn]"}},{"type":"Canvas","id":"go","h":"44pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-extbtn.rcn]"},"events":{"onClick":"https://appstoreconnect.apple.com/apps/${app}/distribution/reviews"},"_note":"外链按 §0.2b 进无 ••• 的单页壳;装了 ASC App 的设备系统会接管。"}]}}
